          "id": "l41-grammar-06",
          "pattern": "Vてやります",
          "zh": "为下位对象做某事，语气较直接，使用对象要谨慎。",
          "en": "Do something for a lower-status recipient; use carefully because it sounds direct.",
          "example": "子どもに絵本を読んでやりました。",
          "practice": [
            {
              "id": "l41-practice-06",
              "skill": "grammar",
              "question": {
                "zh": "表达：我给狗洗了澡。",
                "en": "Say: I washed the dog."
              },
              "options": [
